      "title": "South Africa: 2026 national minimum wage amendment",
      "summary": "Government Gazette 54075, Notice R7083 sets the general national minimum wage at ZAR 30.23 per ordinary hour from 1 March 2026. The Expanded Public Works Programme rate is separately ZAR 16.62 per hour. Learnership allowances are set separately in Schedule 2. This historical event summary does not cover every exemption or sectoral rule and does not certify that any calculator has been updated.",
